  "prefLabel": "He-E 805.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2017-02-21",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-E 805.01 Purpose. The purpose of this rule is to describe the requirements for targeted case management services provided to participants in the home and community based care for the elderly and chronically ill Choices for Independence (CFI) program.\n\nSource. #9242, eff 8-26-08; ss by #11167, INTERIM, eff 8-25-16, EXPIRED: 2-21-17\n\nNew. #12115, eff 2-22-17",
